                     <title type="margin">sbyin sreg</title>
                     <incipit xml:lang="bo">na mo gu ru many+ju g+ho ShA ya/ bla ma mchog dang 'jam dpal gshin rje'i gshed/ /dbyer med zhabs kyi pad+mor phyag byas te/ /dbang drag sbyin sreg rgyud dang rgya gzung gi/ /dgongs don rje btsun bla ma'i gsung bzhin bri/ /...</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="bo">tshul 'di yang / bkra shis lhun po'i rgyud pa grwa tshang dpon slob rnams kyis/ dbang dang drag po'i sbyin sreg ji ltar bya ba'i tshul sbyin sreg rnam bshad chen mo las phyung ba'i lag len du dril ba zhig gyis zhes nan gyis bskul ba la brten nas/ gshin rje'i gshed kyi rnal 'byor pa/ shAkya'i dge slong blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyis/ chos grwa chen po bkra shis lhun po 'i gzims khang chung yid dga' chos 'dzin du bris pa'i yi ge pa ni/ shAkya'i dge tshul rnam dpyod dang ldan pa blo bzang dbang gi rgyal po 'o/ /bkra shis//</explicit>
